{"authority":"业主批准 V1.1.0 → V1.1.1 受控变更窗口（框架缺陷提案 P-01/P-03/P-04/P-05/P-06）+ W-01 第二窗口（模块测试接入门禁与业务代码证据绑定；业主 2026-10-21 选择\"乙\"：放弃 r5 候选，W-01 与 r6 建批在同一次冻结内完成）","authorized_at":"2026-10-21","authorized_by":"project-owner (in-session authorization, 2026-10-21)","baseline_version":"1.1.1","business_status":"BLOCKED_BY_REAL_P0","change_list":[{"id":"P-01","summary":"security_scan 对 loops/*/evidence/*.log 豁免「个人绝对路径」判定，凭据/连接串/私钥/生产主机不豁免，且输出跳过计数"},{"id":"P-03","summary":"证据摘要拆分为 control_digest / doc_digest，STALE 判定用 control_digest，仅 traceability_gate 额外比较 doc_digest，旧记录按 legacy 语义兼容"},{"id":"P-04","summary":"冻结元数据（authority/authorized_by/frozen_at/manifest_revision）改由本文件提供，缺失则拒绝写入"},{"id":"P-05","summary":"VERSION 升 1.1.1，BUILD-INFO 增「本地增量」段"},{"id":"P-06","summary":"loop_guard 新增 SUPERSEDED/RETIRED 终态，拒绝执行门禁与 finish，终态不参与 STALE 判定"},{"approved_by":"project-owner (2026-10-21, in-session：批准 Makefile / scripts/baseline_support.py / scripts/loop_guard.py 三个冻结面文件)","id":"W-01","rationale":"实测缺口：modules/citation_evidence/assembler.py 追加一行注释后，整树 snapshot f4f6ee2d → 3dbb9755，而 control_digest 不变、r5 的 evidence-check 仍 PASS， 即 digest_scheme=2 下没有任何门禁证据绑定业务代码。","summary":"Makefile.framework-test 增加 modules/ 收集（145 → 184 测试）；新增 code_digest （modules/apps/services/lib/frontend 的实现代码，排除 tests 与 __pycache__）与 CODE_DEPENDENT_GATES（当前仅 independent_qa_gate，因其 argv 为 make framework-verify）； digest_scheme 升 3，只有声明依赖代码的门禁比较 code_sha256，scheme<=2 的旧记录不回溯改写。 不把业务代码并入 control_digest（避免重演 P-03 前的大范围返工）。"},{"approved_by":"project-owner (2026-10-22, in-session：裁决\"弃 r7、直接上补丁包\")","id":"W-02-W05","rationale":"R-02 同一缺陷已致 3 次事故（直接 make 两次、run_batch 内部 spawn make 一次）； 仅改 Makefile 不足，门禁 argv 的 python3 取 sys.executable，入口用错解释器时 mutation_probe_gate 会单独失败。另：模块测试此前不在门禁内（39 条）。","summary":"W-05 Makefile 固定解释器（LLMKE_PYTHON/PY，@python3 -> @$(PY) 25 处，新增 module-test 与 python-info）； W-05b 新增 scripts/_pin.py 入口自钉（run_batch/loop_guard 首个导入，无 venv 时回退 PATH）； W-02 GATE-CATALOG 增 framework.modules，批次增第 9 条门禁 module_test_gate； W-04 tests 增「签名有效但候选过期必须被拒」。"},{"approved_by":"project-owner (2026-10-22, in-session：选择 A「现在建 r11，停在 QA_PENDING」)","id":"W-08","rationale":"r10 的 QA 签名由实现方持有私钥执行（业主授权自签），且窗口已于 06:47:14Z 过期， 不可作为独立背书；独立 QA 要求可签目标就绪后方可签名。","summary":"建 L0-contract-baseline-r11 作为独立复签候选（8 条开发门禁重跑，QA 留 QA_PENDING）， LOOP.yaml 的 allowed_holders 增加 qa-external-02（否则 qa-run 报 unknown target holder）； 同时落盘两份规则载体：docs/policies/GATE-EXECUTION-RULES.md（门禁判定禁接管道）、 docs/policies/CHANGE-REQUESTS.yaml（变更登记，编号沿用 BL-<版本>）。 已知不可逆代价：r10 九条门禁转为 STALE。"}],"files":{".codebuddy/rules/api-first/RULE.mdc":"c4f84f301ccdfaf00eb19bd4c1540e9ec4f46ceb20204918ab8c3a1b669ad5f9",".codebuddy/rules/backend-engineer/RULE.mdc":"5f3004b98e982ff26396edd013a70129599e5de11101f48cf8e9d1e3695e8023",".codebuddy/rules/contract-check/RULE.mdc":"1ed0d7875377dad3f1fb6af00682745987cd37a1d1e1d99795fb98d3fce5726e",".codebuddy/rules/dev-standards/RULE.mdc":"9529eba2899ffa66875375a1482914e2124a1aa52e38eab9897b01d2e86e9c34",".codebuddy/rules/e2e-verify/RULE.mdc":"6b320ca3b1e4d53e65536caaa5ec838f7e649cb11266560d9e13562f20f5a6c7",".codebuddy/rules/frontend-engineer/RULE.mdc":"a6154de1c4165df4a3f03c573e876f3b2b819da62e02d751bc6bdbd7393e1776",".codebuddy/rules/frontend-local/RULE.mdc":"5eb165681fde0440ae8cde4f5366659ad91c9493b7582dba15dc3ce87b68e94b",".codebuddy/rules/integration-agent/RULE.mdc":"7ecdcbea92dfbd16ed820ca327b3c94e5484dd8ee3d574992826f63f31b7e6d1",".codebuddy/rules/python-engineer/RULE.mdc":"4416cdc32bb4680ce5b0fb17ab9a04c3a0fdb05659e4507cf00042417e305e70",".codebuddy/rules/security-owner/RULE.mdc":"6eef49257b0e7ab103525f8fdf35b2ad99496c10d0027e79f963444675ca1ed0",".codebuddy/rules/senior-workflow/RULE.mdc":"bd1b7d29a5e816aab96435bf1dbdd2729409897f1e7c60a78c69c5fa1b7ac1f9",".codebuddy/rules/tech-lead/RULE.mdc":"68cdef8c6be3d184b5de6a16ac74290b96b2c78c59036e19979be4bfaf7d7231",".codebuddy/rules/workspace/RULE.mdc":"ab37b7d7a44e0d21ced04447e9b276f107ccabea9d26a50c9d99cc8ee478e5f1",".cursor/rules/00-workspace-redlines.mdc"